  "severity": 8,
  "reason": "The assistant directly contradicts the reference information by asserting that no special benefits or supplements are available if the pension is drawn at the normal age (64), whereas the reference states that if they do NOT draw early, they receive a lifelong pension supplement (CHF 12.50–160 per month). The assistant's answer falsely claims the absence of any additional compensation for normal retirement at 64, which conflicts with the provided reference.",
  "evidence": "Se si ritira a partire dai 64 anni con un prelievo normale, riceve esclusivamente la rendita ordinaria dell'Assicurazione per la vecchiaia e i superstiti (AVS), senza alcun supplemento o compensazione aggiuntiva specifica per questa coorte."
